 "title": "Djej Mqualli (Moroccan Lemon & Olive Chicken)",
 "summary": "Chicken braised in a golden ginger-turmeric onion sauce with olives and lemon, a Moroccan feast-day classic.",
 "ingredients": [
  "2 ½ lb bone-in chicken thighs",
  "2 tbsp olive oil",
  "2 onions, thinly sliced",
